<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Shadow Priest</span></h2>This is an example of the Best in Slot gear available from all PvE sources before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<br/>
<br/>Something to keep in mind is that PVP gear in Mists of Pandaria is competitive in certain slots, items like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85074/malevolent-gladiators-satin-mantle">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Satin Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_cloth_raidpriest_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Satin Mantle</span></a>, which are available when Season 12 opens. If you plan to do some PVP, keep this in mind when you are obtaining gear in that game mode, which could be good in PVE content as well.<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width">
