<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. It is essential to sim yourself as different pieces of gear become available, and reforge stats accordingly based on those pieces.<br/>
<br/>
